sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant API as HTTP API
  participant DB as orchestrator.db
  participant Ex as Executor
  participant W as Worker session
  participant F as gh or glab

  You->>API: kraft item create
  API->>DB: intake, status paused
  You->>API: kraft item resume
  API->>DB: claim, paused to active
  API->>Ex: spawn the walk
  Ex->>Ex: cut the worktree
  Ex->>W: launch the spec author
  W-->>Ex: exit code and result file
  Ex->>DB: gate_requested, status needs_human
  DB-->>You: event over the WebSocket
  You->>API: kraft item approve
  API->>DB: gate_approved, status active
  API->>Ex: spawn the walk at the next node
  Ex->>W: plan, implementation, their gates
  Ex->>F: open a draft merge request
  Ex->>DB: status waiting on CI
  Note over Ex,DB: re-entered when CI settles
  You->>API: approve final_review
  Ex->>F: mark ready, merge
  Ex->>DB: status completed, close beads
